## DeskHelper Pro 1.3.3

**Improvements**
- **Pointer & Scroll** — more accurate detection of the mouse you're actually using: gaming keyboards that expose a mouse interface are correctly excluded, and the active device is matched reliably so per-device settings apply to the right mouse.

]]></description>
